Organization of cultural events concerning the activities of the Academy, and enhancement of its promotion and credibility;

Organization of mass media representatives’ participation in activities of the Academy, monitoring of ASMA related materials published in mass media and keeping the administration informed about them;

Regular publication of articles about reforms carried out in the Academy, discoveries, inventions and innovative activities of departments and laboratories;

Preparation of news announcements to inform the public and staff about events in ASMA;

Organization of administration of ASMA website and daily update of new in the Azerbaijani, English and Russian languages;

To ensure close involvement of ASMA on social networks;

To prepare ASMA’s directory, brochures, posters, and promotional CDs in order to provide applicants and secondary school students with information about the Academy and its structures, to get university-related information outside the country and/or acquaint the visitors with the university.

